2979-  1. **An arrangement retold without a new step** (Nokia AI-RAN collaboration, a carmaker's model on the platform, labs using a system): an arrangement the item only describes as already in place (a collaboration, a customer using a product, a deployment), with no new step, figure or date, is background and not kept, even when the item gives no date. "看不出是旧事的不算重提" (D243 item 6) protects a reported development (a new event, step or figure), not a standing arrangement; guidance and a forecast or plan still in force keep their weight when retold, as before.
