2977-- Alex, on the ruler check of the not-kept statements role-v63 keeps (`research/2026-10-30-noise/ruler-check-2026-10-31.md`; a blind reader agreed with the gold on 93–95% of the controls and on 70% of the entries v63 kept) and the five places put to him with a lean each: "五处都按你的倾向定，计数单位也改; 你要修正尺子；你已经多次因为尺子标准问题陷入假的测量".
2978-- Decided (each is the lean he was given):
2979-  1. **An arrangement retold without a new step** (Nokia AI-RAN collaboration, a carmaker's model on the platform, labs using a system): an arrangement the item only describes as already in place (a collaboration, a customer using a product, a deployment), with no new step, figure or date, is background and not kept, even when the item gives no date. "看不出是旧事的不算重提" (D243 item 6) protects a reported development (a new event, step or figure), not a standing arrangement; guidance and a forecast or plan still in force keep their weight when retold, as before.
2980-  2. **How close another company's matter must be** (a lidar maker's price cut, a partner's reactor going critical): another company's action or figure is kept only when one can say through which of the seven drivers it moves a question about the company (demand, supply and inputs, competition and share, pricing and installed base, product cycle, policy, capital and obligations); a party next to the company only by sharing an article, an event or an ecosystem is not kept.
2981-  3. **A comparison the company, a partner or a third party publishes** ("10x lower cost than closed models", "40% more GPUs in the same power budget", a third party's test): a product detail, not kept; only a competitor's comparison against the company's product is judged by 5.1 (ruling 4 unchanged). A partner's or customer's adoption or integration in the same sentence is still kept.
2982-  4. **A named analyst's view of a new event** ("a Kyber delay widens the window for alternatives"): a reading of an event already recorded that adds no new fact, figure or derivation is not kept; one that adds them is judged by 5.1. The conditional valuation (5.3) is unchanged.
2983-  5. **The counting unit**: a not-kept gold entry counts as kept only when the record that carries it is not itself a matter the gold keeps; not-kept words that ride inside the quote of a kept matter are one record of that matter ("一件事用几句话说仍是一条", standard §2).
2984-- The ruler (Alex: "你要修正尺子"): the standard page goes to version 5 with these rules, then a read-only drift review; the gold's evidence part is re-derived for version 5 (version 4 changed no evidence entry, `gold-v4-evidence-check.md`) by two independent readers with every disagreement decided against the article, written as a new frozen file with every change listed (before, after, reason), the version-3 file untouched (D243 item 11); the opening part of the gold is not re-derived here and the scorer reports no question score until it is. The scorer refuses a gold whose evidence part was made for another version of the page: `final_scores.py` had bypassed `score_gold.py`'s version check and scored rounds since D248 on the version-3 gold, which is the false measurement Alex names.
2985-- Not decided here: the financing-analysis entries (an IRR scenario, a debt-service floor) the blind reader would keep; they are judged by 5.1 in the re-derivation like any entry not on the 5.3 list.

